{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121865","id":4153174008,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc73jGf4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121865","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121865.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121865.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121865","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121865/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121865/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121865/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6c5fba0848a56428c24c7c403cc069c0a6163c08","number":121865,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Update Godot .NET packages","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nEnsures the packages in Godot's .NET projects are the latest compatible versions. Some of the packages have not been updated in a long time and may have bugs or vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\nThis PR is kind of a continuation of #111524, but this time affects all Godot's .NET projects.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nExplanation of the changes I have made:\r\n- Updated all the language versions to C# 12 (the latest C# version supported by the MSBuild version in the current action runners).\r\n- Updated packages which don't seem to be locked to specific versions of .NET to their latest versions.\r\n- Removed explicit reference to `System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs` which was added in #111524, because updating the other packages now addresses the security vulnerability, so the explicit reference is no longer needed.\r\n- Updated from xUnit (deprecated) to xUnit v3. Removed `xunit.runner.visualstudio` which is no longer necessary in xUnit v3.\r\n- Replaced packages like `Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.CodeFix.Testing.XUnit` (deprecated) with packages like `Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.CodeFix.Testing` (suggested alternative).\r\n- Added `TestContext.Current.CancellationToken` to some method calls to fix warnings from xUnit v3.\r\n- Updated packages which have side-effects from upgrading (like `Microsoft.Build.Framework`) to the latest harmless versions.\r\n\r\nAll affected projects now build without warnings or errors. All .NET tests passing.\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repo